// Rule: `ai.spent()` gives what the run's asks took so far, and `ai.spent(by: name)` one agent's; before any ask, nothing, with no cost.
// Spec: 8.4
// expect output: 0 asks, 0 unpriced
// expect output: none
// expect output: none
